"A quest is a mission for the Artonans, with a reward equal to the task."
"Quests carry sub-instructions, secondary assignments and ranked Artonans who may give orders."
"An Avowed can hold several quests at once, each paid separately."
"Quest orders cannot be refused; the System says when an order is official."
"Avowed can be ordered to fight and die for Triplanet citizens."
"The Contract bars dangerous experiments, deprivation, organ harvesting, beatings and forced sex."
"Avowed are not made outright murderers of innocents."
"Summoners can flag danger, shown to the Avowed as colored auras on people."
"Quest updates can change the task mid-quest, and completing it may bring auto-return."
